OL,3,CThree hospitalised after stampede at
OL,4,Cfestival in Barnet
OL,6,FThree people are in hospital after a
OL,7,Fstampede at the Ghana Party in the
OL,8,FPark festival on Saturday evening, in
OL,9,FCopthall Playing Fields, Barnet.
OL,11,FA small fire near the site's entrance
OL,12,Fmeant the festival gates had to be
OL,13,Fclosed, leading to a crowd building up
OL,14,Fand then surging when the gates
OL,15,Freopened.
OL,17,FEmergency services provided medical
OL,18,Fcare, including CPR, to 23
OL,19,Ffestivalgoers.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
