OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785763121
OL,3,CThree hospitalised after stampede at
OL,4,Cfestival in Barnet
OL,6,FPolice, firefighters, paramedics and
OL,7,FLondon's Air Ambulance were all
OL,8,Fdeployed to the scene.
OL,10,FEveryone who was treated has had their
OL,11,Fcondition confirmed as non-life-
OL,12,Fthreatening.
OL,14,FAt around 7pm, the festival was
OL,15,F"abruptly closed", and all remaining
OL,16,Fcrowds were sent away.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
