OL,3,CThree hospitalised after stampede at
OL,4,Cfestival in Barnet
OL,6,FGhana Party in the Park is an annual
OL,7,Foutdoor festival, which began in 2005
OL,8,Fand attracts thousands of people each
OL,9,Fyear, and claims to be the largest
OL,10,FGhanaian event outside of the West
OL,11,FAfrican country.
OL,13,FIn a statement on released on Sunday,
OL,14,Fthe festival's organisers said: "First
OL,15,Fand foremost, our thoughts are with
OL,16,Feveryone who was injured, distressed
OL,17,For otherwise affected by the events
OL,18,Fthat took place.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
