PN,37504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785763121
OL,3,CThree hospitalised after stampede at
OL,4,Cfestival in Barnet
OL,6,F"Seeing members of our community
OL,7,Fimpacted in this way has been deeply
OL,8,Fupsetting. We sincerely apologise and
OL,9,Four hearts go out to everyone involved.
OL,11,F"Following discussions with the
OL,12,Femergency services and our events
OL,13,Fmanagement company the difficult
OL,14,Fdecision was taken to bring the
OL,15,Ffestival to an early close in the
OL,16,Finterests of public safety.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/5
