OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785763121
OL,3,CThree hospitalised after stampede at
OL,4,Cfestival in Barnet
OL,6,F"We remain committed to learning from
OL,7,Fthis incident and will continue to
OL,8,Fwork closely with the relevant
OL,9,Fauthorities as they establish the full
OL,10,Fcircumstances surrounding what
OL,11,Foccurred."
